{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415733","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415733","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041573301:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573302:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573303:1":{"text":"Hmm?","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3116EA8FA7969009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573304:1":{"text":"How peculiar.","source_cn":"……独特的魔法能量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5DC0D6B1D459C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573305:1":{"text":"A ruinous curse taking root in such a... young body.","source_cn":"如此年轻，却与毁灭般的诅咒力量紧密交织。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4403D3796173FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573306:1":{"text":"Impressive. Perilous, too.","source_cn":"惊人，却也危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66760310FDFB1D39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573307:1":{"text":"Y-You can feel it?","source_cn":"……您能感觉到？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98EEA3EA8EDDAFE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573308:1":{"text":"Naturally.","source_cn":"自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACD51C6A0DC27F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573309:1":{"text":"Peril and opportunity often flow from the same source. Better to guide it than let it run wild.","source_cn":"有危必有机。与其任由它潜伏，不如考虑前来莱希拉姆进修。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4562750495F59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573310:1":{"text":"Come to the Serene Lyceum. I can teach you how to work with it and, in time, wield it.","source_cn":"我能教会你理解，乃至驾驭它。如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF67C1364469034AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573311:1":{"text":"Thank you for your offer.","source_cn":"……感谢您的提议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE5D2E9374103820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573312:1":{"text":"But I... I should speak with my sister first.","source_cn":"但我需要……需要先和姐姐商量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0EAB1BAD28B246","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573313:1":{"text":"Prudent. I do admire restraint.","source_cn":"明智的谨慎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B2F4FD04182D058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573314:1":{"text":"Still, the Serene Lyceum's stacks are unmatched in all of Esperia.","source_cn":"不过，莱希拉姆卷帙之浩瀚，冠绝伊索米亚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB34F33C64072791E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573315:1":{"text":"And I'd be happy to speak with the librarian to make a special arrangement. Exclusive night access, perhaps?","source_cn":"我亦将欣然与图书管理员共议，为你破例开放夜间阅览权限。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E39A8204010C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573316:1":{"text":"Night access... to a... massive library?","source_cn":"夜间也开放？……真的有读不完的书吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x773B5EF748469F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573317:1":{"text":"Certainly. Books you could spend a lifetime on.","source_cn":"足以陪伴你度过无数日夜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD47F8596D6F2BF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573318:1":{"text":"For someone who loves the page, that is worth far more than any pleasant promise.","source_cn":"这对于渴求书卷之人而言，应当比任何空泛的承诺都更有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E7B25943A0F3813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573319:1":{"text":"Really? That... that would be incredible! I'll speak to my sister properly. Thank you, ma'am.","source_cn":"……我会认真和姐姐谈谈的。谢谢您，女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE32866C3FDCD527B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊莎贝拉":{"text":"Isabella","source":"伊莎贝拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佐尔娅":{"text":"Zorya","source":"佐尔娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}